            <ArticleTitle>[Osteoarthritis, a painful and crippling illness].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>30-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>All joint tissues are affected by the pathological process which leads to osteoarthritis: cartilage, subchrondal bone and synovial membrane. The speed at which osteoarthritis symptoms develop depends on the patient. There is currently no way of knowing how the disease will develop in a patient.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
